 + 140</p><p>=&gt; 119 + 140 </p><p>=&gt; 259</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What value should come in place of the question mark?</p><p>(3/4 of 400)  -  (5  X  ?) + &#8731;343 = 14</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2358;&#2381;&#2344; &#2330;&#2367;&#2361;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2310;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p><p>(400 &#2325;&#2366; 3/4) - (5 X ?) + &#8731;343 = 14</p>", "options_en": ["50", "55", "65", "60"], "options_hi": ["50", "55", "65", "60"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>(3/4 of 400)  -  (5  X  ?) + &#8731;343 = 14</p><p>=&gt; 300 - (5  X  ?) + 7 = 14</p><p>=&gt; ? = 300/5</p><p>=&gt; ? = 60</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>(3/4 of 400)  -  (5  X  ?) + &#8731;343 = 14</p><p>=&gt; 300 - (5  X  ?) + 7 = 14</p><p>=&gt; ? = 300/5</p><p>=&gt; ? = 60</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify:</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">X(X + 8) + 4<sup>2</sup>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;:</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">X(X + 8) + 4<sup>2</sup>", "options_en": ["196", "1372", "-336", "343"], "options_hi": ["196", "1372", "-336", "343"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>[X (X + 8) + 4<sup>2</sup>]/ [(X + 4)<sup>2</sup> * 1/7<sup>3</sup>]</p><p>=&gt; [X<sup>2</sup> + 8X + 16] * 343/ [(X + 4)<sup>2</sup></p><p>=&gt; [(X + 4)<sup>2</sup> * 343]/(X + 4)<sup>2</sup></p><p>=&gt; 343</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>[X (X + 8) + 4<sup>2</sup>]/ [(X + 4)<sup>2</sup> * 1/7<sup>3</sup>]</p><p>=&gt; [X<sup>2</sup> + 8X + 16] * 343/ [(X + 4)<sup>2</sup></p><p>=&gt; [(X + 4)<sup>2</sup> * 343]/(X + 4)<sup>2</sup></p><p>=&gt; 343</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>The simplified form of the expression :</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">(X + 1/3)(X - 1/3) x 9<sup>2</sup>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;:</p><p><div><div style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;vertical-align: middle;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;display: block; padding: 0;\">(X + 1/3)(X - 1/3) x 9<sup>2</sup>", "options_en": ["18", "56", "72", "89"], "options_hi": ["18", "56", "72", "89"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>[(X + 1/3) (X  -  1/3) * 9<sup>2</sup>]/[(9X<sup>2</sup>  -  1) * 1/8]</p><p>=&gt; [(3X + 1) (3X  -  1) * 81 * 8/9]/[(9X<sup>2</sup>  -  1)]</p><p>=&gt; [(9X<sup>2</sup>  -  1) * 72]/ [9X<sup>2</sup>  -  1]</p><p>=&gt; 72</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>[(X + 1/3) (X  -  1/3) * 9<sup>2</sup>]/[(9X<sup>2</sup>  -  1) * 1/8]</p><p>=&gt; [(3X + 1) (3X  -  1) * 81 * 8/9]/[(9X<sup>2</sup>  -  1)]</p><p>=&gt; [(9X<sup>2</sup>  -  1) * 72]/ [9X<sup>2</sup>  -  1]</p><p>=&gt; 72</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Simplify the following expression:</p><p><img width=81 height=81 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24278/image006.png\"></p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2306;&#2332;&#2325; &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2352;&#2354;&#2368;&#2325;&#2371;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p><p><img width=\"81\" height=\"81\" src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p24278/image006.png\"></p>", "options_en": ["37/15", "11/1