)/2c] = 2c/(2c<sup>2</sup> + 1)</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>a = c + 1/2c</p><p>a = (2c<sup>2</sup> + 1)/2c</p><p>Now a<sup>-1</sup> = 1/a = 1/[(2c<sup>2</sup> + 1)/2c] = 2c/(2c<sup>2</sup> + 1)</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>What value replaces \"?\" in [(3<sup>4</sup> &div; 9) + (5<sup>2</sup> &div; 5)] + (? &div; 2) = 30</p>", "q_hi": "<p>[(3<sup>4</sup> &div; 9) + (5<sup>2</sup> &div; 5)] + (? &div; 2) = 30 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; \"?\" &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2310;&#2319;&#2327;&#2366;?</p>", "options_en": ["24", "28", "30", "32"], "options_hi": ["24", "28", "30", "32"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>3<sup>4</sup> = 81; 81 &div; 9 = 9</p><p>5<sup>2</sup> = 25; 25 &div; 5 = 5</p><p>9 + 5 = 14</p><p>14 + (? &div; 2) = 30 =&gt; ? &div; 2 = 16 =&gt; ? = 32</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>3<sup>4</sup> = 81; 81 &div; 9 = 9</p><p>5<sup>2</sup> = 25; 25 &div; 5 = 5</p><p>9 + 5 = 14</p><p>14 + (? &div; 2) = 30 =&gt; ? &div; 2 = 16 =&gt; ? = 32</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Evaluate for ?: [(&radic;4096 &div; 8) + (2<sup>4</sup> &div; 2)]  X  &#8731;? = 48</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2306;&#2325;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;: [(&radic;4096 &div; 8) + (2<sup>4</sup> &div; 2)] X &#8731;? = 48</p>", "options_en": ["27", "8", "18", "15"], "options_hi": ["27", "8", "18", "15"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>&radic;4096 = 64; 64 &div; 8 = 8</p><p>2<sup>4</sup> = 16; 16 &div; 2 = 8</p><p>8 + 8 = 16</p><p>16  X  &#8731;? = 48 =&gt; &#8731;? = 3 =&gt; ? = 27</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>&radic;4096 = 64; 64 &div; 8 = 8</p><p>2<sup>4</sup> = 16; 16 &div; 2 = 8</p><p>8 + 8 = 16</p><p>16  X  &#8731;? = 48 =&gt; &#8731;? = 3 =&gt; ? = 27</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}]}